n -2176 -1120 -1696 -768 100
This schematic contains the
following systemwide Command
Action Directive (CAD) records
for the NIRI Wavefront Sensor:
.
test  - Test the NIRI WFS.
.
init  - Reinitialize the NIRI WFS.
.
datum - Datum all NIRI components.
.
park  - Park all NIRI components.
.
.
_
